+
+**Status:** Empirical Campaign Addendum (`2026-11-15`), `research/causal-dark-fibers-arg03-20261115` (Draft PR #47)  
+**Companion Manuscript:** [`PAPER.md`](PAPER.md) (`v014`, preserved byte-for-byte unchanged)  
